# arvo-bits-contracts. Backlog

## Round 2 prerequisites

Round 2 (#312) of the post-202605021600 substrate-fundamentals work
lifts the const-generic position on Bits from bare u16 to the typed
Width meta-newtype: Bits\<const N: u16, ...\> becomes
Bits\<const N: Width, ...\>. UContainerFor, IContainerFor,
BitsContainerFor, UArith, IArith, UBitContainer, IBitContainer, and
Narrow::narrow_to::\<const N\> all switch from const N: u16 to
const N: Width.

Prerequisites landed in Round 1 (round 202605021800):
- Signedness lifted to pub const trait
- BitsContainerFor\<N, Sign\> lifted to pub const trait
- IBitPrim parity with BitPrim (full method surface)
- BitAccess / BitSequence / BitLogic blanket impls generalised to
  Bits\<N, S, Sign: Signedness\> with BitsBitPrim\<Sign\> sealed
  bridge

Once Round 2 lands, the meta-newtype layer (IBits, FBits, Width,
MetaCarrier in arvo-storage) becomes load-bearing throughout the
const-generic dispatch tables instead of being a soundness-asserted
companion to bare u16.

